    "title": "Three local projects get state grants - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chuck Vipperman ,\n1 hours ago Some late Christmas presents came in just before the end of the year for a handful of projects in the Danville area. Gov. Glenn Youngkin announced last week $6.2 million in Growth and Opportunity for Virginia grants. That’s “Go Virginia.” The money will go towards 10 projects that are expected to leverage a total of $4 million in future investment. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
